[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10447.51, "timestamp": "02:54:07", "text": "又一次钓鱼。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10450.07, "timestamp": "02:54:10", "text": "你知道，我唯一真正喜欢的游戏"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10453.349, "timestamp": "02:54:13", "text": "想买些东西给你们一起去钓鱼"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10456.63, "timestamp": "02:54:16", "text": "与其他人在一起就是这样。有个 Twitch"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10459.59, "timestamp": "02:54:19", "text": "一款名为“鱼潜伏”的互动游戏"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10462.63, "timestamp": "02:54:22", "text": "钓鱼之类的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10466.23, "timestamp": "02:54:26", "text": "是的，我希望如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10469.11, "timestamp": "02:54:29", "text": "因为我现在直播睡觉的时候，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10471.429, "timestamp": "02:54:31", "text": "任何人都可以在Twitch上钓鱼之类的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10475.429, "timestamp": "02:54:35", "text": "地点。在 YouTube 上，你做不到。但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10493.59, "timestamp": "02:54:53", "text": "日志。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10498.07, "timestamp": "02:54:58", "text": "是的，这是用原木做饵进行抽动式钓鱼的方法。"}]